3.4 Notifications and Alerts 
 Staff gets notified when new orders are assigned. 
 Admin receives alerts for: 
o Failed sync operations 
o Overdue orders (pending for too long) 
 Optional: Email or system notifications for important events. 
3.5 Reporting & Analytics Module 
Generate performance and operational reports, including: 
Staff Performance Report 
 Total orders assigned 
 Orders confirmed 
 Orders delivered 
 Orders cancelled 
 Orders returned 
 Average order processing time 
 Success rate (% delivered / assigned) 
Operational Reports 
 Total Shopify orders vs OMS processed orders 
 Pending vs completed orders 
 Daily / weekly / monthly performance summaries 
Reports should be exportable in Excel/PDF format. 
3.6 Admin Panel Features 
 User (Staff) management (Add / Edit / Disable) 
 Order management overview 
 Manual reassignment of orders 
 Shopify API configuration (Shop URL, Access Token, etc.) 
 Cron job management & logs 
 Report generation 
 Tag mapping (customize tags for each status) 
3.7 Staff Panel Features 
 Dashboard showing: 
o Assigned orders 
o Pending orders 
o Completed orders 
 Order actions: confirm, pack, deliver, cancel, return 
 Notes/comments on orders 
 History of performed actions 
3.8 Automation (Cron Jobs) 
 Fetch Orders: Run every 15 minutes to import new orders from Shopify. 
 Auto Assignment: Divide new orders equally among staff. 
 Status Sync: Update Shopify with latest order statuses/tags. 
 Data Integrity Check: Ensure no duplicate or missed orders. 
