5. Optional Future Enhancements 
 Multi-store management (multiple Shopify stores in one dashboard) 
 AI-based order priority handling (urgent orders, VIP customers) 
 Smart staff load balancing (based on current workload, not just equal 
distribution) 
 Integration with courier APIs for delivery tracking 
 KPI dashboard with real-time staff performance 
 Telegram / WhatsApp notification bot for staff alerts 
6. Deliverables 
1. Fully functional Laravel-based OMS web application 
2. Connected Shopify integration via API 
3. Cron jobs configured on server 
4. Admin and staff user interfaces 
5. Reporting dashboard 
6. Deployment documentation 
7. API documentation (Swagger or Postman collection) 
